                <head>Persons arrested.</head>
                <p>The Diario del Imperio says: The government has ordered the arrest of the
                    following persons, disturbers of public peace and order, in conformity with
                    article 77 of the statutes:</p>
                <p>Feliciano Chavarria, General José Rojo, Mr. Kampherr, Pedro Echavarria, Augustin
                    Cruz, Augustin Zires, (general,) Manuel M. Puente, Juan Mateos, Ignacio Ramirez,
                    General José de la Parra, Manuel Parada, Gabriel M. Islas, Antonio M. Zamacona,
                    Padre Ordonez, José M. Arroyo, Joaquin Alcalde, and J. A. Gamboa.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
